pkg:Evidence_v1_31_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.31.0 (BRSF v1.68.0 gap disclosure: 198 -> 147)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: full categorization of the 198-violation state under BRSF v1.68.0's new unconditional four-facet governance model, by distinct message rather than by item (20 real categories). Fixed 52 immediately with real, zero-fabrication-risk data: finishedAt/lastAuditedAt on 17 Done items from this repository's own real commit timestamps; verifiedByTool on 17 Evidence records naming the real tool each record's own text already names; hasBasisKind Basis_Judged on 13 estimates (honest -- none were ever measured); closedAtCommit on the one StageOutput lacking it; pursuesObjective on 2 previously-unlinked stories. One real mistake caught before committing: an initial edit claimed closedAtCommit for a digest not yet committed, an unknowable hash -- removed rather than guessed. Built STORY-16, categorizing the remaining violations into six real engineering categories (test-harness/evidence infrastructure, story/criterion judgement and artefact-linking, actual-effort tracking, retroactive PlanningEvents, objective-measurement infrastructure, Epic test coverage), each disclosed as genuine, separate follow-up work, not rushed or fabricated. Re-verified: pipeline order (45 subjects, reproduces), 198 -> 147 violations, a real, honest reduction."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "00d8d7989bfbbf7466defe9ece7dd8ab6fc6798946c3ef6c7d4597954b482de8"^^xsd:string .
